  "description": "Test build of Ekko's Chronobreak as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Ekko so his ult takes him back to where he was 4 seconds ago at once, healing more for the health he lost in those 4 seconds (+4% per 1%, up to +200%), and the AI casts it when he is low, after a burst, or to land on enemies (the main pack's leaves an anchor and snaps back 4 seconds later with a fixed heal, since data cannot remember past positions). Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
